<view class="page"><view class="title">上传素材</view><view class="muted">视频和照片将追加到当前司机的素材包，并自动记录类型、大小和上传时间。</view><view class="card picker" bindtap="chooseFiles"><view class="plus">＋</view><view class="pick-title">从相册选择照片或视频</view><view class="muted">支持多选，单个文件暂限 200 MB</view></view><view wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="path" class="card file"><view class="row between"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.status}} · {{item.progress}}%</text></view><view class="bar"><view style="width:{{item.progress}}%"></view></view></view><button class="primary submit" loading="{{uploading}}" disabled="{{uploading}}" bindtap="submit">{{uploading ? '正在上传' : '开始上传'}}</button></view>
